  "prefLabel": "Puc 102.02 Jurisdiction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 102.02 Jurisdiction. The commission’s jurisdiction shall include:\n\n(a) The general supervision of the state’s public utilities as outlined by RSA 374:3;\n\n(b) Acting as the arbiter between the interests of public utilities and customers; and\n\n(c) Ensuring that the rates, fares, charges, and prices to customers are just, reasonable, and lawful.\n\nSource. #14185, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc100.html"
}
